        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_95e55a1953cc45fe9ab67f181dc2e67a",
      "statement": "The durable export effect is keyed by (scopeId, target, canonicalVacancyId, actionType) independent of the snapshot and transitions reserved -> external_id_acquired -> confirmed; reserve uses onConflictDoNothing so only the insert winner proceeds to POST, and a confirmed reservation yields a skipped result reusing the crosswalk.",
