    {
      "id": "claim_3f3a2ca207c74742bbafcd78eb939f88",
      "statement": "On a newly acquired reservation, commit_export maps the aanvraag, calls spottWriteClient.createVacancy, persists the returned id with provider_response provenance, then confirmSpottCreateEffect GETs the id and only on a matching detail id does finalizeConfirmed atomically insert crosswalk, attempt, receipt, and set the effect to confirmed in a serializable transaction.",
