      "id": "claim_7357ed67110c41638c99c113258cbc51",
      "statement": "The export persistence layer owns export effects, external id crosswalk, export attempts, and external receipts; the crosswalk is inserted with onConflictDoNothing on (scopeId, target, canonicalVacancyId, actionType) and guarded by assertExportIdOwnerAvailable reverse-ownership checks inside serializable transactions to prevent two canonical vacancies binding the same external id.",
