      "id": "claim_7fdf5c2484df42cf83cc1aea9d7849a7",
      "statement": "The Spott write client is injected into commit_export via CommitExportDeps.spottWriteClient; in production-stub (liveEnabled false) createVacancy returns a synthesized spott-fixture id recorded in an in-memory registry that getVacancy reads back so confirm succeeds, while live mode requires SPOTT_API_KEY and SPOTT_LIVE=1 but setting SPOTT_LIVE=1 does not wire a write client into the production registry.",
