      "statement": "bun run export:reconcile-spott runs apps/server/src/export/reconcile-spott-export.ts, which connects directly to the database (not a server HTTP endpoint or Spott API), parses strict CLI flags rejecting bearer/actor/role args and foreign scopes, and delegates to reconcileSpottExportId; a dry-run runs read-only repeatable-read returning a planHash, and --apply requires that exact 64-char planHash in a serializable transaction.",
