      "id": "claim_e6704880500a4c4092d67f22d827b6a8",
      "statement": "Reconciliation authenticates a signed Better Auth bearer via SPOTT_EXPORT_RECONCILIATION_BEARER_TOKEN, verifies the session in the same transaction, and requires the principal to hold both ROLE_OPERATOR and PERM_EXPORT; actor identity and permissions come from authenticated records and the CLI accepts no actor or role arguments.",
