    {
      "id": "claim_e1d411ebfe3b491b8d8830dd29d2d244",
      "statement": "Reconciliation only binds an externally verified Spott id to an existing reserved effect with no id and no crosswalk using manual_evidence provenance, transitioning the effect to external_id_acquired and appending a reconcile_spott_export_id audit event; it refuses on missing reservation (RESERVATION_NOT_FOUND), already-evidenced/confirmed reservation (RESERVATION_NOT_RECONCILABLE), existing crosswalk (CROSSWALK_EXISTS), external id already bound (EXTERNAL_ID_CONFLICT), missing/changed plan hash, or snapshot/approval mismatch, and it does not create a confirmed receipt or call the Spott API.",
